@startuml inventory-domain-foundation
title QualiTrack Inventory - Client contracts (not connected to routes yet)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
interface RawMaterial {
  id: number
  laboratoryId: number
  code: string
  name: string
  unit: InventoryUnit
  minimumStock: number
}
interface RawMaterialBatch {
  id: number
  rawMaterialId: number
  laboratoryId: number
  supplier: string
  batchNumber: string
  initialAmount: number
  availableAmount: number
  receivedOn: string
  expiresOn: string
  status: RawMaterialBatchStatus
}
interface AvailableReceipt
interface ConsumeRawMaterialBatchCommand {
  laboratoryId: number
  rawMaterialBatchId: number
  productBatchId: number
  amountUsed: number
  unit: InventoryUnit
  operationId: string
}
interface RawMaterialBatchConsumption {
  stockBefore: number
  stockAfter: number
  operationId: string
}
RawMaterial "1" <-- "0..*" RawMaterialBatch : catalog reference
RawMaterialBatch ..> AvailableReceipt : server eligibility projection
ConsumeRawMaterialBatchCommand ..> RawMaterialBatchConsumption : future API
note bottom of RawMaterialBatch
  Status: QUARANTINED / RELEASED / OBSERVED / REJECTED.
  New receipts require review before release.
  ISO date strings; backend owns business date and expiry rules.
  Quantity arithmetic, stock validation and tenant authorization run in backend.
end note
note bottom of ConsumeRawMaterialBatchCommand
  No HTTP endpoint, route, mock store or browser-side stock deduction is added yet.
  Next increment: real API adapters and explicit migration of legacy material usage.
  Existing Laboratory and Batch screens remain unchanged.
end note
@enduml
